16:33:09 --- repl-help: HELP
16:33:09 Commands:
16:33:09   BEGINCFG ... ENDCFG        - add sensor config (multi-line)
16:33:09   BEGINCFG|k=v|...|ENDCFG    - add sensor config (inline with '|', supports \|)
16:33:09   BEGINRULE ... ENDRULE      - add rule (multi-line)
16:33:09   BEGINRULE|k=v|...|ENDRULE  - add rule (inline with '|', supports \|)
16:33:09   RUN / STOP                 - control sampling
16:33:09   CLEAR                      - clear sensors + rules
16:33:09   SHOW / SHOWRULES           - show sensors / rules
16:33:09   CLEARRULES                 - clear only rules
16:33:09   HELP                       - this text
16:33:09 
16:33:09 Example inline rule (HMC5883L big-endian X,Z,Y at 0x03):
16:33:09 BEGINRULE|name=GY511_MAG|source=GY511_ACC|calc=mx=s16be(0)|calc=mz=s16be(2)|calc=my=s16be(4)|calc=mag=sqrt(mx*mx+my*my+mz*mz)|when=mag>350|action=log:MAG change detected|ENDRULE
